    "sub_name": "公司治理與社會責任",
    "sub_ename": "CORPORATE GOVERNANCE AND SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY",
    "describe_ch": "透過課程講授、實務專題與小組合作學習，讓學生建立具備公司治理與社會責任的基本概念，了解公司治理與社會責任議題、相關治理的決策理論、組織文化對公司治理決策之影響，以及企業的社會責任。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of the course is to introduce the basic concepts of corporate governance and social responsibility through teaching, practice project and group cooperation learning.  Let students understand issue of corporate governance and social responsibility , related decision theory of governance, organization culture impact on corporate governance policy and social responsibility。",
